1
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,440
<i>Why does she always
have to keep hurting me?</i>

2
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,640
PREVIOUSLY

3
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:17,360
I hate her, Mom. I hate her.

4
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:20,320
<i>I'm going to throw a party for Hathaya.</i>

5
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:24,640
<i>Chayanee will get her drunk.</i>

6
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,760
<i>Then you take care of her.</i>

7
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,240
Hey!

8
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,000
What the hell is going on?

9
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:37,400
This isn't what everyone thinks.

10
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,400
I can explain.

11
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:43,680
Everyone saw what kind of person you are,

12
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,920
and you still have the nerve to deny it?!

13
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:46,880
Wait!

14
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,880
Listen to him first.

15
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,240
Ramil, tell us what happened.

16
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,440
I saw a man

17
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,600
walking toward Hathaya's room,

18
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,000
so I followed him

19
00:03:58,080 --> 00:04:00,680
and saw that he was trying
to force himself on her.

20
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,040
That's why I went in to help her.

21
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,840
I can't believe

22
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:06,600
you'd make up a lie like that
just to save yourself.

23
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:10,640
But the state you and Hathaya were in

24
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:13,080
made it perfectly obvious
what the two of you were doing.

25
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:19,200
I'm telling the truth.

26
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,720
Sir, if you don't believe me,

27
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:23,840
have every man here brought in.

28
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,600
I punched him.

29
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:28,000
Whoever has bruises is the attacker.

30
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,360
Go get all the workers
and bring them here.

31
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:38,560
Oh, this is far too serious.

32
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,440
I'll handle it myself.

33
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,200
I'll knock on every door.

34
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:45,040
If anyone has injuries
or bruises like Ramil said,

35
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:47,280
I'll drag him straight to jail myself.

36
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,560
Pong.

37
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,720
Pong. It's me.

38
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,720
I almost had her,
then that bastard showed up.

39
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:15,400
Don't say another word.
Turn off the light and go to bed.

40
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:18,280
Are you sure Mr. Pichai
won't turn me over to the police?

41
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,640
Don't worry. I'll handle it.

42
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,520
Go on.

43
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,440
Turn off the light.

44
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,960
Father, I checked every room.

45
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,640
None of our workers or gardeners

46
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:41,320
has a single bruise on them.

47
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,120
That's impossible. Someone has to!

48
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:45,000
Are you accusing me of lying?

49
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,920
Ramil, that's enough.

50
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:52,480
Hathaya, what happened?

51
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:57,560
I... I don't know, Grandpa.

52
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:01,920
How can you not know?
Ramil was lying in your room.

53
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:04,600
All I remember is that

54
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:08,200
I was very drunk
and had a terrible headache.

55
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:10,960
Then Chaya took me back to my room.

56
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:13,080
Is that true?

57
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:18,920
No.

58
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:23,000
I was drinking with Hathaya,

59
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,400
then I went to refill our drinks.

60
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,360
When I came back, she was gone.

61
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,000
That's not true.

62
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:44,480
You were drinking with me,

63
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,920
then you took me back to my room.

64
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,240
I asked you to stay with me,

65
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:52,600
and you promised you would.

66
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,600
Hathaya, you must have been really drunk.

67
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,840
The person who took you back to your room

68
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,880
and stayed with you was Ramil.

69
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,440
I told everyone already.

70
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:10,760
I saw Hathaya lying there with a man.

71
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,480
But I never imagined

72
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:15,280
Ramil would do something so vile.

73
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:16,840
That's not true.

74
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,400
I never touched Hathaya like that.

75
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:23,280
Ramil, stop lying.

76
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,800
Everyone saw with their own eyes
what was happening.

77
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,600
Mr. Pichai,

78
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,600
I sincerely apologize

79
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:39,000
for everything that happened today.

80
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,680
Someone from your household

81
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:43,120
has disgraced Father.

82
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,640
How will you take responsibility
for this, Mr. Saksit?

83
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,120
Well...

84
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,440
I...

85
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:54,640
- Well...
- Well, Mr. Saksit?

86
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,120
How will you take responsibility?

87
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:58,680
Well, I...

88
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,920
I'll take responsibility.

89
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:10,200
How are you going to take responsibility?

90
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,080
I ruined Hathaya’s reputation.

91
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,560
I'll take care of her.

92
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,800
Sir,

93
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,680
what do you think?

94
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:34,159
Ramil, you're a gentleman.

95
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,720
If you did this, then you
have to take responsibility.

96
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,400
You will take Hathaya as your wife.

97
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,520
Yes, sir.

98
00:08:58,680 --> 00:08:59,680
Grandpa.

99
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,640
But I don't want that.

100
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,280
Hathaya.

101
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,920
I should never have taken you in.

102
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,640
You've always been jealous of my son.

103
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,360
You take everything
that belongs to Raiwin.

104
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,960
I set everything up for Raiwin

105
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,960
to use Hathaya's fame for the election.

106
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,440
And you came along

107
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,680
and ruined the whole plan.

108
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:43,320
You're completely brainless.

109
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:47,840
And you even had the nerve
to volunteer to take responsibility.

110
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,680
What difference does it make?

111
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:52,720
Even if I hadn't said I would
take responsibility for Hathaya,

112
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:55,000
you would've made me do it anyway.

113
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:57,960
Take responsibility
for something I never even did!

114
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,920
Someone like you has no right

115
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,480
to decide anything!

116
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:04,040
I own your life!

117
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:08,840
I'm the one who gives the orders.

118
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,600
Get that through your head!

119
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:17,160
Raiwin,

120
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,600
Hathaya and I

121
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,960
really didn't do anything.

122
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,400
If you love her,

123
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:28,280
- go tell Mr. Pichai.
- Don't lecture me.

124
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:31,280
You ruined everything.

125
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,960
Remember this.

126
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:36,240
I don't take another man's leftovers.

127
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:45,560
Mom, I really didn't do anything.

128
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,480
I never violated Hathaya.

129
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:50,240
Stop causing trouble for once!

130
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:54,240
If I could turn back time,

131
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,760
I should've let your father
take you and raise you.

132
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,400
Then I wouldn't have to worry
about you every single day.

133
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,200
Mom.

134
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:04,440
You don't believe me either?

135
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,320
Fine!

136
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,960
If I'm such a terrible, selfish person,

137
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,880
then I'll become what you want me to be!

138
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:12,720
Grandpa.

139
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,200
I know I was very drunk that night,

140
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:19,040
but Ramil and I really
didn't go into the room together.

141
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,880
Nothing happened between us.

142
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:24,320
Ramil doesn't need
to take responsibility for my life.

143
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:28,120
Please let me stay here
and take care of you.

144
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,720
Please, Grandpa.

145
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,760
Father.

146
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:40,720
I had the staff pack all of Hathaya's

147
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:42,400
clothes and belongings

148
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:45,160
just as you ordered.

149
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:52,360
When Mr. Saksit came to ask
for your hand on Raiwin's behalf,

150
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:54,760
I didn't object.

151
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:58,400
I thought you deserved a good man

152
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,600
and that your life might get better.

153
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,520
But before anything happened,

154
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,800
you secretly slept
with his little brother.

155
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,200
You brought this filthy mess
into my house.

156
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:12,680
You're no different from your mother.

157
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:16,440
Since you chose
to behave so disgracefully,

158
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,400
go live with Ramil.

159
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,760
I'm not going to hold a wedding
and let people look down on us.

160
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:27,120
If you finish working
the full month you agreed to,

161
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:30,320
I'll pay you 500,000.

162
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,880
After that, I never want to see you again.

163
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,360
Grandpa! Grandpa!

164
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:44,600
I'm begging you.
Please don't send me away.

165
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,080
Let me stay here and take care of you.

166
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:50,240
- Please, Grandpa.
- Take your filthy hands off me.

167
00:15:51,040 --> 00:15:54,680
And get your bags out of here.
I don't want to see your face anymore!

168
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,840
If you tell me to do something,

169
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,760
I'll do it.

170
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:12,240
But I want to make one thing clear.

171
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,760
I have never done anything disgraceful.

172
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:18,880
I am not like my mother.

173
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:27,079
Chaya.

174
00:17:28,119 --> 00:17:30,200
I really remember

175
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:34,160
you taking me back to my room last night,

176
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,960
and you stayed with me.

177
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:40,640
Yes. I was with you.

178
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:43,760
Then why didn't you tell Grandpa?

179
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:51,080
Because I hate you.

180
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:55,840
I hate you, Hathaya.

181
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,840
I'm going to bring Hathaya back.

182
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,520
I'll wait for you, Daddy.

183
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,960
And I'll hurry back to you.

184
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:02,120
Okay.

185
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:09,240
Dad promised me he would come back.

186
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:15,480
But he died because he went after you.

187
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:19,120
He died because of you.

188
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:25,320
I tried to come to terms with it.

189
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:27,400
As I grew up, Grandpa loved me

190
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:30,520
and took care of me. I was happy.

191
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:36,240
I missed you so much, Grandpa.

192
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:38,440
I love you more than anyone in the world.

193
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,880
Then you came back

194
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:48,360
and started taking everything in my life.

195
00:18:58,560 --> 00:19:01,560
You won Grandpa over
by acting like such a good person.

196
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,280
You kept showing off at work.

197
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,880
And now you've even taken Raiwin from me.

198
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:13,200
So, of course, I had
to take back what belongs to me.

199
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:33,720
Hathaya, your husband
is here to pick you up.

200
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:35,040
Go.

201
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:39,680
And let me give you my blessing.
May my beloved granddaughter...

202
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:42,640
Oh, no. My most hated granddaughter

203
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:44,400
find nothing but ruin.

204
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:02,720
Miss Hathaya. Let me help you.

205
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:10,440
I wish you the best of luck, Miss Hathaya.

206
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:13,320
Please take care of yourself.

207
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:31,120
She's gone, sweetheart.

208
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:33,920
I finally got rid of her.

209
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,440
Nothing happened between us.

210
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:08,960
So why do you have to take responsibility?

211
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:17,320
I tried everything,
but nobody believes me.

212
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:19,600
Even my own mother doesn't believe me.

213
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:22,080
Then make them see the truth.

214
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:25,080
Prove it. Make them understand.

215
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:26,720
Believe me.

216
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:29,720
I wanted to search
the whole place for that pervert,

217
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:32,880
but your aunt refused.
What was I supposed to do?

218
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:41,600
Why did something like this
have to happen to me?

219
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:43,960
Why do I have to come live with you?!

220
00:21:47,160 --> 00:21:49,480
Instead of thanking me

221
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:51,440
for saving you from being raped

222
00:21:52,600 --> 00:21:55,440
and standing up for you,
you're blaming me?

223
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:58,600
Fine.

224
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:01,040
If you hate staying here
so much, get in the car.

225
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:04,680
Let's go.

226
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:07,560
No! Don't take my suitcase!

227
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:09,760
I'm so terrible, right?
Get in. I'll take you back.

228
00:22:09,840 --> 00:22:13,480
- No! Let go... Let go!
- Get in the car. I'll take--

229
00:22:17,920 --> 00:22:19,520
I can't go back.

230
00:22:21,080 --> 00:22:23,560
I have to finish working here
for one full month.

231
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:28,520
I need the money to pay
for my grandmother's treatment.

232
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:44,080
Don't!

233
00:22:46,080 --> 00:22:47,040
Come inside.

234
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:53,640
When you're ready,

235
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:55,720
follow me.

236
00:23:16,040 --> 00:23:17,360
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

237
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:19,360
Get out of here

238
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:21,600
or I'll call the police.

239
00:23:22,760 --> 00:23:24,600
Save what strength you have left.

240
00:23:25,120 --> 00:23:26,320
Where's your daughter?

241
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:29,640
No idea. She doesn't live here anymore.
Hasn't been back in a long time.

242
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:31,320
What kind of game are you playing?

243
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:34,040
She called and told me to come here.

244
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:36,440
- Who called?
- Your daughter.

245
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:39,480
Or did she lie to us? Trash the place.

246
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:43,640
- No!
- You bastards, stop right now!

247
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:52,040
Here's your money.

248
00:23:57,080 --> 00:23:58,400
The loan agreement.

249
00:24:09,120 --> 00:24:12,640
If you're ever short on cash,
the boss says you can always borrow again.

250
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:17,400
With interest that high? I'm rich now.

251
00:24:19,280 --> 00:24:20,120
Let's go.

252
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:29,160
Hathai, where the hell have you been?

253
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:31,720
And where did you get
the money to pay them?

254
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:36,160
Look at the way you're dressed.

255
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:39,520
And that gold necklace.
Where did you get all this money?

256
00:24:39,600 --> 00:24:41,080
Did you rob someone?

257
00:24:41,760 --> 00:24:45,880
Come on, Mom. Could you think
something good about me for once?

258
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:50,720
I ran for my life and ended up staying
at that restaurant where I used to work.

259
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:53,280
Then I met a new man.

260
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:58,120
And this one is really good to me, Mom.

261
00:24:58,200 --> 00:25:01,240
He loves me
and gives me everything I want.

262
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:04,680
What does your husband do
for a living to have that much money?

263
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:08,280
You don't need to know.

264
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:12,720
So, Mom. Are you still
fainting and feeling sick?

265
00:25:13,320 --> 00:25:17,480
Depends on the day. I just keep
taking my medicine and painkillers.

266
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:29,960
Take this for now.

267
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:34,960
When I get more money,
I'll take you in for surgery.

268
00:25:35,040 --> 00:25:36,640
We won't have to wait for Hathaya.

269
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,760
I have to go, Mom.

270
00:25:45,840 --> 00:25:47,600
You're not staying here?

271
00:25:48,480 --> 00:25:50,560
Bring your man to meet me too.

272
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:52,800
Some other day.

273
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:58,280
Who the hell is your man?

274
00:26:00,040 --> 00:26:03,880
Please, just don't let her
cause any more trouble.

275
00:26:16,840 --> 00:26:18,880
Let me help you.

276
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:23,120
Thank you.

277
00:26:27,320 --> 00:26:30,360
Only Max and I live in this house.

278
00:26:30,960 --> 00:26:33,800
Welcome, ma'am.

279
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:38,480
I'm not staying here as his wife.

280
00:26:38,560 --> 00:26:40,760
I'm staying here as a coworker.

281
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:50,920
Max, take her suitcase to my room.

282
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:52,880
I told you already.

283
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:55,600
I'm not staying here as your wife.

284
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:57,400
I'm not sleeping in the same room as you.

285
00:26:59,800 --> 00:27:02,080
It's not like I'm dying
to sleep with you either.

286
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:05,000
I'll sleep in Max's room. Okay?

287
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:12,800
And another thing.

288
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:16,920
If you're not here as my wife,

289
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,160
then you're the maid.

290
00:27:22,240 --> 00:27:23,360
The maid?

291
00:27:23,440 --> 00:27:27,640
Exactly. You'll clean, cook,

292
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:32,080
and take care
of all the laundry too. Okay?

293
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:35,720
- But I--
- Don't say anything.

294
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:36,880
That's an order.

295
00:27:42,320 --> 00:27:45,400
I am not washing your socks.
And I'm definitely not washing your...

296
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:51,640
underwear. I'm not your wife.

297
00:27:57,560 --> 00:27:58,720
Whatever.

298
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:08,080
Wait.

299
00:28:14,520 --> 00:28:16,600
You're done eating?
Cut the grass and tidy up after.

300
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:34,280
Why are you wearing long sleeves?

301
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:38,040
Why are you covering yourself up so much?

302
00:28:38,800 --> 00:28:41,080
The sun is hot, Auntie.

303
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:44,680
Is it the sun,
or are you hiding something?

304
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:46,520
It's hot. I'm afraid of the sun.

305
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:50,720
I didn't even put on sunscreen.

306
00:28:51,320 --> 00:28:52,880
Roll up your sleeve and let me see.

307
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:55,560
What the hell, Auntie?

308
00:28:56,320 --> 00:28:58,120
Why should I have to do what you say?

309
00:28:58,720 --> 00:29:03,160
Last night, some pervert went into
Miss Hathaya's room and tried to rape her.

310
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:05,840
If you have nothing to hide,
and you didn't do it,

311
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:10,000
then roll up your sleeve. If you refuse,

312
00:29:10,080 --> 00:29:12,720
I'll tell Master that you're

313
00:29:12,800 --> 00:29:13,960
the most suspicious one here.

314
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:16,120
You're talking nonsense.

315
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:17,120
Roll up your sleeve.

316
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,520
- I told you. My skin is sensitive.
- Roll up your sleeve!

317
00:29:20,280 --> 00:29:21,320
Madam is calling you.

318
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:23,520
Hurry. She's furious right now.

319
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:24,560
Okay.

320
00:29:26,080 --> 00:29:28,400
Before you go, roll up
your sleeve and let me see.

321
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:32,760
What is wrong with you?

322
00:29:32,840 --> 00:29:37,360
Ramil admitted responsibility. He already
took Hathaya home to live with him.

323
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:39,640
Why are you still doing this?

324
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:43,160
I trust Mr. Ramil,
and I trust Miss Hathaya too.

325
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:46,280
So you're saying

326
00:29:46,360 --> 00:29:48,680
you don't trust Madam?

327
00:29:49,280 --> 00:29:51,360
You want to challenge her?

328
00:29:51,440 --> 00:29:53,520
I'll tell Madam and have her fire you.

329
00:29:57,960 --> 00:30:01,680
Look. You're a maid.

330
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:03,920
Don't try to play detective
and catch criminals too.

331
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:06,120
You know why?

332
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:08,320
Because every one of them I've seen

333
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,280
ends up dead.

334
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:14,720
If you have work to do, go do it.

335
00:30:26,280 --> 00:30:27,400
Pong?

336
00:30:28,280 --> 00:30:30,880
Why are you here? I didn't call you.

337
00:30:32,840 --> 00:30:33,840
I called him.

338
00:30:35,840 --> 00:30:37,080
Chamoi!

339
00:30:37,160 --> 00:30:39,920
You're using my name
to order people around now?

340
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:41,240
You've gone too far.

341
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:44,280
I was helping you.

342
00:30:44,360 --> 00:30:46,800
Ann was investigating

343
00:30:46,880 --> 00:30:48,800
who went into Miss Hathaya's room.

344
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:52,200
Good thing I stepped in and saved him.

345
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:55,160
Otherwise, Ann would've caught him.

346
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:57,280
Wait.

347
00:30:58,760 --> 00:31:01,680
Chamoi. You know about this?

348
00:31:02,280 --> 00:31:04,640
Yes, madam.

349
00:31:05,600 --> 00:31:09,920
I do everything for you.

350
00:31:11,600 --> 00:31:14,080
And, well,

351
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:17,520
I think a little appreciation
would be nice.

352
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:18,720
Ugh.

353
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:25,640
Here, take it.

354
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:29,520
Oh, thank you, ma'am!

355
00:31:35,840 --> 00:31:37,040
Pong.

356
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:40,360
Put some cream
on that bruise on your neck.

357
00:31:40,960 --> 00:31:42,520
Make sure it fades quickly.

358
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:46,520
And don't let anyone catch you. Go.

359
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:48,840
Yes, madam.

360
00:31:51,280 --> 00:31:52,240
Don't go yet.

361
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:57,440
I have a job for you.

362
00:31:58,680 --> 00:32:00,160
Everyone did great today.

363
00:32:01,760 --> 00:32:03,760
Same time tomorrow.

364
00:32:03,840 --> 00:32:06,200
Don't be late. We're
on a tight schedule. Understand?

365
00:32:06,280 --> 00:32:07,480
- Yes.
- Yes.

366
00:32:07,560 --> 00:32:09,120
See you tomorrow.

367
00:32:10,280 --> 00:32:11,120
Let's go.

368
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:12,640
Chayanee.

369
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:17,240
What are you planning to have
Pong and Chamoi help you with?

370
00:32:18,440 --> 00:32:21,280
Miss, don't tell me

371
00:32:21,360 --> 00:32:24,200
you want me doing construction work.

372
00:32:24,280 --> 00:32:27,520
I can't handle that.
My arms and legs are too weak.

373
00:32:27,600 --> 00:32:29,640
I'm not making you do construction.

374
00:32:30,960 --> 00:32:32,760
I want you to deal with the workers.

375
00:32:36,360 --> 00:32:38,920
Hathaya brought these workers in

376
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:43,160
and promised that if any
of them caused trouble,

377
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,720
she would take full responsibility.

378
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:49,920
So you're trying to find a way
to get Hathaya sent home.

379
00:32:50,520 --> 00:32:52,440
I'm going to send her home

380
00:32:52,520 --> 00:32:55,080
without a single baht.

381
00:32:58,040 --> 00:33:00,720
If there's anything
you want me to do, just tell me.

382
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:16,720
Delicious food is here!

383
00:33:21,760 --> 00:33:24,080
Why did you bring so much stuff?

384
00:33:24,920 --> 00:33:27,160
What is all this?
Are you selling something?

385
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:30,280
We're not selling anything. It's for you.

386
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:33,800
What's going on?
Who's kind enough to give us all this?

387
00:33:34,400 --> 00:33:38,160
My boss is a fan of yours.

388
00:33:38,240 --> 00:33:42,080
He saw your video
and felt sorry for you. So he sent us

389
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:44,880
to bring all this over to cheer you up.

390
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:46,360
No, no. We can't accept all this.

391
00:33:48,280 --> 00:33:50,520
My boss

392
00:33:50,600 --> 00:33:54,640
really wanted you to have it. Accept
his kindness. You have to finish it all.

393
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:56,080
Then please thank your boss for us.

394
00:33:56,840 --> 00:34:00,200
No problem. We'll get going now.

395
00:34:00,280 --> 00:34:03,760
- Thank you.
- Let's go.

396
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:15,120
Madam.

397
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:17,880
They completely fell for it.

398
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:20,560
Think they'll eat and drink all that?

399
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:24,560
With all that delicious food?
They'd be crazy not to.

400
00:34:24,639 --> 00:34:27,480
You were the one who told me
they're heavy drinkers, Mom.

401
00:34:27,560 --> 00:34:29,880
That's right.

402
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:32,719
This time, they'll miss work,

403
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:35,800
and Hathaya will have
to take responsibility.

404
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,920
Tomorrow, we can wait for the good news.

405
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:53,880
Why would they suddenly

406
00:34:53,960 --> 00:34:56,880
give us all this food for free?

407
00:34:57,600 --> 00:35:01,320
I already told you.
They like us. They're fans.

408
00:35:01,400 --> 00:35:05,400
How do you know it isn't poisoned?

409
00:35:05,480 --> 00:35:09,560
Have you been watching too many dramas?

410
00:35:09,640 --> 00:35:10,480
All right.

411
00:35:11,160 --> 00:35:14,600
I'll taste it for you.

412
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:25,280
Ya!

413
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:28,040
Just kidding. It's delicious.

414
00:35:28,120 --> 00:35:30,240
If none of you want it,
I'll eat it all myself.

415
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:31,320
Hey!

416
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:32,520
Let's eat.

417
00:35:35,160 --> 00:35:36,000
TWELVE BOTTLES

418
00:35:37,040 --> 00:35:38,000
Move.

419
00:35:39,720 --> 00:35:40,560
Wit,

420
00:35:41,160 --> 00:35:43,240
two or three bottles should be enough.

421
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:45,080
Getting drunk will ruin work tomorrow.

422
00:35:45,160 --> 00:35:47,240
Come on. Just a little
for medicinal purposes.

423
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:49,120
Drink responsibly.

424
00:35:49,200 --> 00:35:51,080
Don't do anything that'll make
Hathaya look bad.

425
00:35:51,160 --> 00:35:52,920
On my honor,

426
00:35:53,000 --> 00:35:56,560
I swear I'll only have a tiny bit.
I'll save my strength for work tomorrow.

427
00:35:59,360 --> 00:36:01,800
Let's drink!

428
00:36:04,200 --> 00:36:05,520
Let's eat.

429
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:07,960
- Here!
- Dig in!

430
00:36:08,040 --> 00:36:09,280
Let's eat.

431
00:36:09,360 --> 00:36:10,760
Come on.

432
00:36:26,560 --> 00:36:28,320
I'm going to check the model home.

433
00:36:29,960 --> 00:36:31,440
Wait. Wait.

434
00:36:36,720 --> 00:36:37,640
What?

435
00:36:38,720 --> 00:36:40,120
Am I that disgusting?

436
00:36:41,080 --> 00:36:44,120
No. You just startled me.

437
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:45,960
You suddenly reached for me.

438
00:36:47,200 --> 00:36:50,000
You forgot your bag.

439
00:36:53,400 --> 00:36:54,400
Thanks.

440
00:36:56,480 --> 00:36:57,480
Boss,

441
00:36:59,120 --> 00:37:00,280
this is all who showed up.

442
00:37:02,520 --> 00:37:03,840
Why are there so few?

443
00:37:03,920 --> 00:37:05,640
I don't know either.

444
00:37:05,720 --> 00:37:08,920
Yesterday, when everyone finished work,
I kept reminding them not to be late.

445
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:10,480
Aow's crew hasn't shown up either.

446
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:24,200
‎Sir.

447
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:32,600
There are a lot of reservations.

448
00:37:33,240 --> 00:37:35,400
Miss Hathaya takes
very good care of the customers.

449
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:38,040
Anyone visiting the model home
decides to reserve right away.

450
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,480
Father,

451
00:37:42,560 --> 00:37:45,200
why don't you go inspect
the construction site?

452
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:50,080
Ramil is already supervising the work.
I don't want to interfere.

453
00:37:50,160 --> 00:37:52,400
Grandpa, you shouldn't
trust people so easily.

454
00:37:52,480 --> 00:37:54,520
Some of the workers
didn't even show up today.

455
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:03,480
DO NOT ENTER

456
00:38:11,360 --> 00:38:13,600
Ya! Wake up!

457
00:38:13,680 --> 00:38:16,280
Wit! Aow! Everyone, wake up!

458
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:20,120
- Ya.
- Hathaya...

459
00:38:20,200 --> 00:38:24,520
Come drink with us.

460
00:38:24,600 --> 00:38:26,240
Ya!

461
00:38:26,320 --> 00:38:29,840
Wit! Aow! Wake up! Everyone, get up!

462
00:38:35,640 --> 00:38:37,320
Hathaya, move.

463
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:45,720
Aow! Flood! The water's coming. Run!

464
00:38:47,320 --> 00:38:48,680
Hello, sir.

465
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:50,600
There's no flood.

466
00:38:50,680 --> 00:38:54,320
I'm so sorry.

467
00:38:55,200 --> 00:38:58,600
What happened?
Why are all of you this drunk?

468
00:38:59,720 --> 00:39:04,360
Yesterday, some fans brought us food.
They said they liked us.

469
00:39:06,040 --> 00:39:09,560
I warned everyone not to drink
so much that it would interfere with work.

470
00:39:10,560 --> 00:39:13,480
And look at you. You joined them too.

471
00:39:16,040 --> 00:39:17,720
How are you supposed to work

472
00:39:18,560 --> 00:39:20,520
when you're this drunk?!

473
00:39:21,680 --> 00:39:26,000
Looks like they have to take today off.
Good thing Mr. Pichai isn't in today.

474
00:39:29,480 --> 00:39:31,400
MR. PICHAI

475
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:33,320
Mr. Pichai.

476
00:39:41,680 --> 00:39:42,600
Yes, sir.

477
00:39:45,160 --> 00:39:46,120
I'm at the site.

478
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,800
Okay. See you shortly.

479
00:39:53,400 --> 00:39:54,480
He's inspecting the site.

480
00:39:55,160 --> 00:39:57,280
We're dead.

481
00:39:57,360 --> 00:40:00,640
He strictly banned drinking.
If he sees you like this,

482
00:40:00,720 --> 00:40:01,920
you'll all be fired.

483
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:04,720
None of you thought this through!

484
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:07,360
Have you forgotten that Hathaya
vouched for all of you?

485
00:40:07,440 --> 00:40:09,760
If he finds out about this,

486
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:11,760
Hathaya is the one who'll suffer. Get it?

487
00:40:13,680 --> 00:40:15,240
Hathaya, we're sorry.

488
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:18,440
We're really sorry. Please forgive us.

489
00:40:19,040 --> 00:40:21,400
I can work. Can you guys work?

490
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:24,440
- Yes.
- Yes.

491
00:40:24,520 --> 00:40:28,360
I'll hurry and change.
Then I'll get straight to work.

492
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:35,320
You and Max should go meet Grandpa first.

493
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:37,680
I'll take care of everything here. Go.

494
00:41:00,600 --> 00:41:02,840
Everyone, hurry.

495
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:04,640
Faster, please.

496
00:41:06,360 --> 00:41:08,800
Pick everything up. Get rid of all of it.

497
00:41:11,040 --> 00:41:14,080
Come on, give me the broom.

498
00:41:14,160 --> 00:41:16,880
Hurry, everyone. Please hurry.

499
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:20,720
Huh? Why are there so few workers?

500
00:41:21,800 --> 00:41:23,280
Where did everyone go?

501
00:41:24,640 --> 00:41:27,280
Exactly. And Ramil is gone too.

502
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:29,360
Hello, sir.

503
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:32,880
I told you not to trust him.

504
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:35,800
Lately, Ramil has been slacking off

505
00:41:35,880 --> 00:41:37,800
and making mistakes constantly.

506
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:41,840
I'm sorry if I gave you the impression
that we were slacking off, Ms. Liu.

507
00:41:41,920 --> 00:41:46,400
I was talking to the contractor.

508
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:49,960
He's about to come in
and install the electrical wiring.

509
00:41:50,680 --> 00:41:52,280
That's right, sir.

510
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:55,960
Where are all our workers?
Is this everyone?

511
00:41:56,640 --> 00:41:58,000
Where are the new workers?

512
00:42:00,040 --> 00:42:01,760
Well, Mr. Ramil?

513
00:42:01,840 --> 00:42:05,520
Where are the workers Hathaya brought in?

514
00:42:12,040 --> 00:42:13,600
Is everyone ready?

515
00:42:13,680 --> 00:42:16,360
- Ready!
- We're ready.

516
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:19,440
- I forgot my hard hat!
- Come on.

517
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:22,400
Aow, hide the beer bottles.

518
00:42:22,480 --> 00:42:24,200
- Make sure they're out of sight.
- Yes.

519
00:42:25,800 --> 00:42:27,840
Let's go. Hurry!

520
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:31,280
- Don't forget anything. ID and hard hat?
- I have them.

521
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:34,120
Come on! Hurry!

522
00:42:38,800 --> 00:42:41,600
- I think they're coming--
- Well?

523
00:42:42,240 --> 00:42:44,000
Where are Hathaya's workers?

524
00:42:45,520 --> 00:42:46,720
Chayanee.

525
00:42:47,880 --> 00:42:49,320
Were you looking for my workers?

526
00:42:49,920 --> 00:42:52,320
Hello. Hello.

527
00:42:53,080 --> 00:42:56,360
Where have you all been?
Why weren't you at the work site?

528
00:42:57,360 --> 00:42:59,360
I sent them to help with another job.

529
00:42:59,440 --> 00:43:02,440
Father asked the workers.
You don't need to answer for them.

530
00:43:02,520 --> 00:43:05,160
Well? Where were you?

531
00:43:06,960 --> 00:43:10,120
We went... went...

532
00:43:10,200 --> 00:43:13,360
Went where? You can't even speak properly.

533
00:43:13,440 --> 00:43:15,280
My husband has a stutter.

534
00:43:15,360 --> 00:43:18,000
We went to help with the garden
at the model home.

535
00:43:18,080 --> 00:43:20,040
Next time, unless it's urgent,

536
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:23,800
don't move workers to another job.
We're rushing things over here.

537
00:43:25,160 --> 00:43:26,760
I'm sorry, Grandpa.

538
00:43:27,600 --> 00:43:31,360
Grandpa, why don't we go
to the model home?

539
00:43:33,720 --> 00:43:35,040
What's the matter?

540
00:43:35,120 --> 00:43:38,840
Well, Hathaya said she sent
the workers to work on the garden.

541
00:43:39,640 --> 00:43:41,840
The garden must look beautiful now.

542
00:43:42,840 --> 00:43:45,440
I thought you might like to take a walk.

543
00:43:46,560 --> 00:43:48,080
Let's go, Father.

544
00:43:48,920 --> 00:43:50,080
I don't want to see the garden.

545
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:52,800
I'd rather inspect the construction.

546
00:43:53,400 --> 00:43:55,080
And I need to talk to Ramil
about Phase Two.

547
00:43:55,160 --> 00:43:57,960
Yes, sir. This way, please.

548
00:43:58,040 --> 00:44:00,920
It's hot here. Let's go.

549
00:44:01,000 --> 00:44:03,720
Let me hold the umbrella.

550
00:44:07,120 --> 00:44:08,920
Go back to work.

551
00:44:09,000 --> 00:44:10,280
Yes, Hathaya.

552
00:44:16,320 --> 00:44:18,160
Sorry about my husband.

553
00:44:20,520 --> 00:44:22,360
Go!

554
00:44:22,440 --> 00:44:24,120
Can't you walk properly?

555
00:44:24,200 --> 00:44:27,000
I'm nauseous. Morning sickness.

556
00:44:28,640 --> 00:44:31,080
- Sympathy morning sickness.
- Get far away from me!

557
00:44:34,120 --> 00:44:36,080
I need to get back to work.

558
00:44:36,160 --> 00:44:38,720
I don't want to waste any time.

559
00:44:44,080 --> 00:44:45,080
Ugh.

560
00:45:00,400 --> 00:45:01,800
They drank so much.

561
00:45:02,560 --> 00:45:04,040
How are they still able to work?

562
00:45:04,680 --> 00:45:06,320
I think they can really hold their liquor.

563
00:45:06,400 --> 00:45:11,040
Next time, we should buy them
another two or three cases, madam.

564
00:45:12,800 --> 00:45:14,280
Nobody asked you.

565
00:45:15,120 --> 00:45:17,520
Chayanee, I hate that Hathaya.

566
00:45:17,600 --> 00:45:19,960
Look at her strutting around
as if nothing happened.

567
00:45:22,920 --> 00:45:24,440
Don't worry, Mom.

568
00:45:25,200 --> 00:45:27,680
I'll find a way to get rid of her.

569
00:45:29,200 --> 00:45:30,200
Come on.

570
00:45:31,240 --> 00:45:32,720
Walk faster.

571
00:45:34,960 --> 00:45:36,080
Quickly.

572
00:45:40,400 --> 00:45:44,040
If you have something to say to Hathaya,

573
00:45:44,120 --> 00:45:45,160
say it now.

574
00:45:46,120 --> 00:45:50,160
Hathaya, I'm sorry.

575
00:45:50,240 --> 00:45:51,920
I'm really sorry.

576
00:45:52,480 --> 00:45:54,080
I'm sorry.

577
00:45:54,960 --> 00:45:58,400
Hathaya, please forgive us.

578
00:45:59,240 --> 00:46:01,240
I'm not forgiving any of you.

579
00:46:04,920 --> 00:46:06,800
Mr. Pichai once asked me

580
00:46:07,880 --> 00:46:11,120
why I decided to help you

581
00:46:16,200 --> 00:46:18,520
when you weren't my relatives
or even people I knew.

582
00:46:21,280 --> 00:46:24,560
I helped because I believed that
if people are given a good opportunity,

583
00:46:24,640 --> 00:46:26,160
they can build a better life.

584
00:46:28,520 --> 00:46:31,560
But you threw away
the opportunity I gave you.

585
00:46:35,600 --> 00:46:36,800
Do you realize

586
00:46:37,840 --> 00:46:40,240
that if Mr. Pichai had found out today

587
00:46:40,320 --> 00:46:43,520
that you were drunk
and didn't show up for work,

588
00:46:44,920 --> 00:46:46,600
you would've been fired?

589
00:46:48,720 --> 00:46:50,320
Then where would you live?

590
00:46:53,080 --> 00:46:54,280
What would you eat?

591
00:46:58,800 --> 00:47:02,000
Or do you want to go back to wandering
around with nowhere to live?

592
00:47:02,080 --> 00:47:05,720
Do you want people looking down
on you again, calling you garbage

593
00:47:05,800 --> 00:47:07,480
and troublemakers?

594
00:47:08,680 --> 00:47:09,640
Is that what you want?

595
00:47:14,560 --> 00:47:15,640
Aow.

596
00:47:17,480 --> 00:47:19,440
You and the others risked your lives

597
00:47:19,520 --> 00:47:22,320
traveling all this way
to work in Thailand.

598
00:47:24,840 --> 00:47:28,080
It wasn't easy to find a job
or get your documents.

599
00:47:31,480 --> 00:47:33,680
You had to spend so much money.

600
00:47:36,120 --> 00:47:38,200
Why didn't you think about your parents?

601
00:47:38,280 --> 00:47:40,600
Why didn't you think about
your kids waiting back home?

602
00:47:42,840 --> 00:47:44,960
You came here to work,

603
00:47:45,040 --> 00:47:48,520
send money home, and eventually
return to your family.

604
00:47:48,600 --> 00:47:49,680
Isn't that what you wanted?

605
00:47:50,840 --> 00:47:54,560
So why throw everything away
just for a little fun?

606
00:48:00,600 --> 00:48:02,600
If Mr. Pichai had found out,

607
00:48:04,240 --> 00:48:07,160
I would've lost my job and been sent home.

608
00:48:08,760 --> 00:48:10,280
What did I do wrong?

609
00:48:18,200 --> 00:48:22,040
I came here to work and save money
for my grandmother's treatment.

610
00:48:22,800 --> 00:48:25,560
I tried to do something good
and help all of you.

611
00:48:27,960 --> 00:48:30,480
Why did you repay me like this?

612
00:48:41,040 --> 00:48:42,920
If everyone is going to be selfish,

613
00:48:44,120 --> 00:48:46,040
then I'll be selfish too.

614
00:48:47,160 --> 00:48:49,480
From now on,
we stay out of each other's lives.

615
00:48:50,360 --> 00:48:51,840
I'm not helping anyone anymore.

616
00:48:57,080 --> 00:48:59,960
Hathaya! I'm sorry!

617
00:49:00,040 --> 00:49:02,880
- I'm sorry!
- I'm sorry!

618
00:49:02,960 --> 00:49:04,600
Please forgive me.

619
00:49:04,680 --> 00:49:06,640
<i>Mom! Don't transfer any money to Dad.</i>

620
00:49:07,240 --> 00:49:10,720
<i>If you don't pay me back,
don't ever show your face to me again.</i>

621
00:49:11,520 --> 00:49:12,680
<i>I hate you.</i>

622
00:49:12,760 --> 00:49:15,760
From now on, you'll have a new foreman

623
00:49:15,840 --> 00:49:16,800
supervising your work.

624
00:49:16,880 --> 00:49:19,040
But Ramil already supervises us.

625
00:49:19,640 --> 00:49:23,280
He's been nowhere to be seen for days.
And you call that a good supervisor?

626
00:49:23,360 --> 00:49:24,880
<i>You should know</i>

627
00:49:24,960 --> 00:49:26,680
<i>that what you're doing</i>

628
00:49:26,760 --> 00:49:28,920
is causing a lot of trouble
for the workers.

629
00:49:29,000 --> 00:49:32,040
Don't act like my mother and lecture me.

630
00:49:32,640 --> 00:49:35,080
Have you forgotten yourself?
Thinking you're my wife now?

631
00:49:35,160 --> 00:49:36,920
Don't act so disgusting with me.

632
00:49:37,000 --> 00:49:38,960
NEXT EPISODE

633
00:51:32,960 --> 00:51:35,240
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
